  <details class="faq-item">
    <summary>
      <span><span class="lang-es">¿Cómo configuro mi moneda local y presupuesto base en FlowMint App?</span><span class="lang-en">How do I set up my local currency and base budget in FlowMint App?</span></span>
      <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
