    <p class="lang-en">FlowMint splits your income into three pockets: 50% for essential needs, 30% for lifestyle, and 20% for savings and investing. You can adjust these percentages to fit your own goals.</p>
  </details>

  <details class="faq-item">
    <summary>
      <span><span class="lang-es">¿Puedo usar FlowMint App sin conexión a internet?</span><span class="lang-en">Can I use FlowMint App without an internet connection?</span></span>
      <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
